{
  "id": 1204,
  "description": "### 📸 𝗣𝗢𝗟𝗔𝗥𝗢𝗜𝗗 📸 &quot;Captured in a moment, frozen in time.&quot; ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ \n\n### 𝙇𝙊𝙍𝙀 📜 \nBorn from the flash of a cosmic lens, the members of POLAROID are beings of light tasked with documenting the history of Solaris Isle. It is said that our strength is &quot;developed&quot; through the consumption of Timitoo’s Secret Brew 🍯, a golden elixir that grants us the focus to strike faster than a shutter click. We have appeared to stand against the darkness, one snapshot at a time.\n\n### 𝘼𝘽𝙊𝙐𝙏 𝙐𝙎 ✨ \nWe are a new, highly active, and friendly guild. We are currently accepting any player pursuing any path! We are a laid-back group with the intention of enjoying IdleMMO together. Whether you are a veteran or just started today, we want to help you grow.\n\n \n### 𝙍𝙐𝙇𝙀𝙎 &amp; 𝙍𝙀𝙂𝙐𝙇𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉𝙎 📋\n\n**Activity:** Members inactive for over 30 days will be removed to keep the guild fresh. 📉\n\n**Contribute:** Join raids and help out when you can! We run at least 1 every day ⚔️\n\n**Hydration:** Only Timitoo’s Secret Brew is permitted. 🍯\n\n**The Creed:** Capturing the Moment, Living for the Brew. 🐢\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 𝗣𝗢𝗟𝗔𝗥𝗢𝗜𝗗 𝗘𝘀𝘁. 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟲 — 𝗗𝗲𝘃𝗲𝗹𝗼𝗽𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗚𝗿𝗲𝗮𝘁𝗻𝗲𝘀𝘀. 📸",
